  "prefLabel": "Res 7305.02 Trail Use Limitations",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 7305.02 Trail Use Limitations. No person shall use the following equipment on the Franconia Notch recreational trail:\n\n(a) Skateboards;\n\n(b) Roller skates, rollerblades, or roller skis;\n\n(c) Children’s tricycles shall be prohibited except where permitted from the parking lot to the Old Man Viewing Area;\n\n(d) Motorized bicycles; or\n\n(e) Electronic Personal Assistive Mobility Devices (EPAMD), such as Segways.\n\nSource. #6167 eff 1-18-96, EXPIRED: 1-18-04\n\nNew. #8127, INTERIM, eff 7-27-04, EXPIRED: 1-23-05\n\nNew. #8532, eff 1-1-06 (from Res 7305.06); ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res7300.html"
